{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-cloud-jobs-cost","title":"量子云接入、任务调度与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/algorithms-cloud-applications/quantum-cloud-jobs-cost","wordCount":2576,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"量子云接入-任务调度与成本\">量子云接入、任务调度与成本</h1><p>在本地跑完一个量子电路的仿真，转到真实硬件上的第一步不是写代码，而是算钱：同一份 100-shot 的两比特门线路，在 Rigetti Cepheus 上按 shot 计费只要不到一杯咖啡钱，在 IonQ Forte 上却可能触发 <strong>168.195 美元</strong>的最低计费（Azure Quantum 定价页，2026-04）；而在 IBM 上，一次「跑多久算多久」的按秒计费从 <strong>$1.60/秒</strong>起（IBM Quantum 定价页，2026-10）。<strong>量子计算目前没有统一的计价单位</strong>——每个供应商各自发明了一套计量、一套排队规则和一套优先级体系。本文拆解 2026 年量子云的三种接入面（SDK 抽象层、原生门模型、混合作业）与四种计价范式，给出可落地的成本估算公式和调度陷阱。它是<a href=\"../control-compilation-stack/circuit-compilation-mapping\">线路编译与比特映射</a>与<a href=\"../control-compilation-stack/runtime-scheduling-feedback\">运行时调度与实时反馈栈</a>之上的<strong>经济学层</strong>：编译决定电路长什么样，运行时决定它能不能按时跑，而计费模型决定你到底该不该跑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四种计价范式\">核心概念：四种计价范式</h2><p>把主流平台按「什么触发扣费」归类，只有四类。理解这一点比记住任何具体数字都重要，因为费率是浮动的，范式是稳定的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>计量单位</th>\n<th>代表平台</th>\n<th>触发成本增长的量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按 shot / 按任务</td>\n<td>每次执行任务费 + 每 shot 费</td>\n<td>Amazon Braket 按需模式</td>\n<td>shot 数 × 比特数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按门- shot（gate-shot）</td>\n<td>提交的门数 × shot 数</td>\n<td>IonQ（Azure AQT 令牌）、Quantinuum（HQC）</td>\n<td>线路深度 × shot 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按执行时间</td>\n<td>QPU 墙钟秒 / 毫秒增量</td>\n<td>IBM（QPU 秒）、Rigetti（10 ms 增量）</td>\n<td>硬件占用时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按小时预约</td>\n<td>整机小时租金</td>\n<td>Braket 预约、Pasqal（EUR/小时）</td>\n<td>预约时长（无论用不用）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>按 shot 计费</strong>最常见。Amazon Braket 所有 QPU 统一收 <strong>$0.30/任务</strong>的任务费，再叠加设备专属的 shot 费：Rigetti Cepheus 仅 <strong>$0.000425/shot</strong>，IQM Emerald <strong>$0.0016/shot</strong>，QuEra Aquila <strong>$0.01/shot</strong>，IonQ Forte <strong>$0.08/shot</strong>，AQT IBEX 则高达 <strong>$0.0235/shot</strong>（AWS Braket 定价页，2026-04）。同一段线路在这几台机器上的 shot 费相差近 <strong>190 倍</strong>——因为计价单位背后是物理实现：超导的 Cepheus 每 shot 只做一次微波读出，而离子阱的门操作本质更慢更贵。</p>\n<p><strong>按门- shot 计费</strong>把「线路复杂度」直接写进账单，这对变分算法极其不友好。Azure Quantum 上 IonQ 用「量子令牌（AQT）」结算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.000220</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.000975</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AQT = m + 0.000220\\,(N_{1q}\\cdot C) + 0.000975\\,(N_{2q}\\cdot C)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">QT</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.000220</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.000975</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是每次程序执行的最低价（开启误差缓解 <strong>$97.50</strong>，关闭 <strong>$12.4166</strong>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{1q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{2q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是提交的单/双比特门数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是 shot 数（Microsoft Learn《Pricing Plans for Azure Quantum Providers》，2026-04 更新）。注意多控门被按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6(N-2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个双比特门计费——一个三控 NOT 门记作 12 个双比特门，这类线路在编译期就被「翻译」成了账单。Quantinuum 的 HQC 公式同理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>5000</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HQC = 5 + \\frac{C\\,(N_{1q} + 10 N_{2q} + 5 N_m)}{5000}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">QC</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>双比特门权重是单比特门的 <strong>10 倍</strong>，测量/态制备（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）是 <strong>5 倍</strong>。这两个公式把「拓扑感知编译」从纯技术优化变成了直接省钱的动作：减少一个 CNOT 交换，就少扣一次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\times C/5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/5000</span></span></span></span></span> 的 HQC。</p>\n<p><strong>按执行时间计费</strong>的风险在于它把「硬件被占用多久」和「你要多少结果」解耦。IBM 的 Qiskit Runtime 按 QPU 秒计费，起步价 <strong>$1.60/秒</strong>；Rigetti 在 Azure 上按 <strong>$0.02 / 10 毫秒增量</strong>计（Microsoft Learn 同上）。对浅线路这是灾难性的：一个只需几微秒的电路，如果被墙钟时间主导（编译、加载、初始化），按秒计费会远贵于按 shot 计费。</p>\n<p><strong>按小时预约</strong>是唯一「用不用都收钱」的模式：Braket 的整机预约价从 QuEra Aquila 的 <strong>$2,500/小时</strong>到 IonQ Forte 的 <strong>$7,000/小时</strong>（AWS Braket 定价页，2026-04），Pasqal 的 Orion Beta（Fresnel）按 <strong>EUR 3,000/QPU-小时</strong>收（Microsoft Learn，2026-04）。预约的价值在于<strong>消除跨租户排队</strong>并获得独占容量，但闲置的预约时段照收不误——只有把小时填满才划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调度-队列-会话与配额\">调度：队列、会话与配额</h2><p>计价之外，第二个决定实际吞吐的是排队模型。所有平台共用一套基本结构：<strong>共享设备队列 + 优先级 + 并发上限</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;用户提交量子任务&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;接入模式&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;按需提交&quot;| C[&quot;进入设备共享队列&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;Session 会话&quot;| D[&quot;独占时间窗&lt;br/&gt;窗口内任务免排队&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;Batch 批处理&quot;| E[&quot;成组提交&lt;br/&gt;组内共享队列位&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;小时预约&quot;| F[&quot;独占整机时段&lt;br/&gt;无跨租户排队&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;并发上限 + API 速率限制&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;按 QPU 秒计费直至会话结束&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I[&quot;预约时段内任务与 shot 打包&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; J[&quot;硬件执行 → 结果回传&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"用户提交量子任务\"] --&gt; B{\"接入模式\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"按需提交\"| C[\"进入设备共享队列\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"Session 会话\"| D[\"独占时间窗&lt;br/&gt;窗口内任务免排队\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"Batch 批处理\"| E[\"成组提交&lt;br/&gt;组内共享队列位\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"小时预约\"| F[\"独占整机时段&lt;br/&gt;无跨租户排队\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"并发上限 + API 速率限制\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"按 QPU 秒计费直至会话结束\"]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I[\"预约时段内任务与 shot 打包\"]\n    G --&gt; J[\"硬件执行 → 结果回传\"]\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p><strong>会话（Session）模式</strong>是 2025–2026 年各家最核心的调度抽象。它给一个交互式工作流留出一段独占时间窗，窗口内连续提交的电路不用重新排队——这正是变分算法（VQE/QAOA）需要的，因为每次参数更新都要重跑。代价是窗口按 QPU 秒计费，哪怕你在两轮之间做经典优化、QPU 空转也在扣钱。<strong>批处理（Batch）模式</strong>则相反：把一批不相关或松散相关的作业打包提交，共享一个队列位置，牺牲交互性换取吞吐，适合超参数扫描这类「提交后等结果」的场景。<strong>这组二者的取舍决定了混合算法的真实成本结构</strong>：会话贵在空转，批处理贵在延迟。</p>\n<p><strong>配额与速率限制</strong>是最容易被忽略的成本。Braket 在服务配额里明确规定：每账户每区域最多 <strong>3 个并发混合作业</strong>、CreateQuantumTask <strong>20 次/秒（突发 40）</strong>、GetQuantumTask <strong>100 次/秒</strong>（AWS《Braket endpoints and quotas》，2026）。这些数字直接决定轮询式客户端的设计：一个每秒轮询一次任务状态的朴素循环会在几百个并发任务时撞上 API 限流。真正省钱的客户端是<strong>推送/回调式</strong>的，而不是轮询式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本估算与优化\">成本估算与优化</h2><p>有了范式，就能写出工程上可用的估算式。对一个变分算法，总成本近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>iter</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>exec</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>量子执行</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>session</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>QPU</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>会话空转</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>job</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>job</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>经典计算</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}} \\approx \\underbrace{N_{\\text{iter}} \\cdot C_{\\text{exec}}}_{\\text{量子执行}} + \\underbrace{T_{\\text{session}} \\cdot r_{\\text{QPU}}}_{\\text{会话空转}} + \\underbrace{N_{\\text{job}} \\cdot C_{\\text{job}}}_{\\text{经典计算}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">量子执行</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">iter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exec</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2958em;vertical-align:-1.6124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">会话空转</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-