ght:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">session</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">QPU</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2958em;vertical-align:-1.6124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">经典计算</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">job</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">job</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 Braket 的一次 Hybrid Job 为例，经典侧默认用 <code>ml.m5.xlarge</code>（<strong>$0.23/小时</strong>），若用 GPU 实例 <code>ml.p3.8xlarge</code> 则是 <strong>$14.688/小时</strong>（AWS Braket 定价页，2026-04）——当迭代轮数上千时，<strong>经典优化器实例费往往比量子 shot 费还高</strong>。这是初学者最容易算错的一项：他们盯着 shot 单价，却忽略了每轮循环都在烧经典算力。</p>\n<p>三条可落地的优化规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>把 shot 预算压到统计需要的最低点。</strong> 误差缓解（error mitigation）会成倍抬高成本——IonQ 的最小执行费在开启缓解时从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12.4166</mn><mtext>跳到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12.4166 跳到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.4166</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">跳到</span></span></span></span></span>97.50（约 7.9 倍），且 IonQ 的误差缓解任务要求至少 <strong>2,500 shot</strong>。先用零噪声外推（ZNE）在小 shot 下验证电路正确，再决定要不要为缓解付费。</li>\n<li><strong>用拓扑感知编译减少交换门。</strong> 在按门- shot 计费的平台上，编译器的每一次 SWAP 插入都直接在账单上多记 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\times C/5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/5000</span></span></span></span></span> 个 HQC（Quantinuum 公式）。这与<a href=\"../control-compilation-stack/circuit-compilation-mapping\">线路编译与比特映射</a>是同一件事的两面。</li>\n<li><strong>在本地仿真器上榨干免费额度。</strong> Braket 的本地仿真器完全免费，SV1 按需仿真器 <strong>$0.075/分钟</strong>，且新账户前 12 个月每月赠送 1 小时按需仿真。任何能在仿真器上答完的问题都不该上真机——这在「仿真器跑得动」的规模区间内是纯节省。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"接入面-sdk-抽象-vs-原生门模型\">接入面：SDK 抽象 vs 原生门模型</h2><p>最后一个成本维度是<strong>迁移成本</strong>。三家平台的 SDK 都提供「门模型」抽象，但底层原生门集不同：IonQ 的原生门是任意角度旋转 + MS 门，超导平台是固定角度的 CZ/CNOT + 单比特门。当你的线路用了平台不支持的抽象门，编译期就会把它拆成多个原生门，而<strong>账单按原生门数计算</strong>。同一个 abstract 电路，跨平台迁移后账单可能翻倍——这不是 bug，是门集差异的必然结果。</p>\n<p>工程上的应对是<strong>在接入层做归一</strong>：用 OpenQASM 3 或 QIR 作为中间表示，把平台专属的编译与计费逻辑封装在适配器里，而不是让业务代码直接调用 vendor SDK。这样切换后端时，只需要重新编译而不是重写算法——这也与<a href=\"../error-correction-fault-tolerance/qec-codes-logical-qubit\">量子纠错码与逻辑比特</a>里的抽象层次保持一致的思路：<strong>越靠近硬件的层，越不该被上层逻辑依赖</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"断裂点与小结\">断裂点与小结</h2><p><strong>三个尚未解决的问题。</strong> 其一，<strong>计价单位不可比</strong>：AQT、HQC、QPU 秒、shot 四套单位之间没有官方换算，跨平台比价只能靠跑同一基准电路实测，业内仍缺一个公认的「每逻辑门成本」标尺。其二，<strong>预约制的利用率陷阱</strong>：$7,000/小时的整机预约，若一次实验实际只用了 20 分钟，等效单价就翻了 3 倍——预约适合确定会填满的基准测试，不适合探索性研究。其三，<strong>误差缓解的成本曲线不透明</strong>：缓解深度与 shot 数、经典后处理时间非线性增长，各平台尚未公开完整的成本模型，采购时只能按经验倍率（如 IonQ 的约 7.9 倍）保守估算。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>四种计价范式</strong>——按 shot、按门- shot、按执行时间、按小时预约——决定了成本随什么量增长，比记住任何费率都重要。</li>\n<li><strong>按门- shot 计费把编译优化变成省钱动作</strong>：Quantinuum 的 HQC 公式给双比特门 10 倍权重，减少一个交换门直接减账单。</li>\n<li><strong>会话 vs 批处理</strong>是混合算法的核心取舍：会话贵在 QPU 空转，批处理贵在排队延迟；Braket 每账户默认仅 <strong>3 个并发混合作业</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>经典计算常是隐藏的大头</strong>：Braket GPU 实例 $14.688/小时，迭代上千轮时可能超过量子 shot 费。</li>\n<li><strong>误差缓解显著抬价</strong>（IonQ 约 7.9 倍最小费），且要求至少 2,500 shot——先在小 shot 上验证正确性再决定是否为缓解付费。</li>\n<li><strong>跨平台比价仍无统一标尺</strong>，最有价值的工程投资是把平台专属逻辑封装在归一化的接入层之后。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"量子云接入、任务调度与成本","id":"量子云接入-任务调度与成本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四种计价范式","id":"核心概念-四种计价范式"},{"level":2,"text":"调度：队列、会话与配额","id":"调度-队列-会话与配额"},{"level":2,"text":"成本估算与优化","id":"成本估算与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"接入面：SDK 抽象 vs 原生门模型","id":"接入面-sdk-抽象-vs-原生门模型"},{"level":2,"text":"断裂点与小结","id":"断裂点与小结"}],"prev":{"title":"NISQ 混合算法与变分方法实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/algorithms-cloud-applications/nisq-hybrid-algorithms"},"next":{"title":"量子优势验证、AI 前沿与可信边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/algorithms-cloud-applications/advantage-verification-limits"}}